        "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #612. Replaced shared sessionIterationMap attribution with session-scoped update logger closures plus explicit detach/replace cleanup on session rotation/end/dispose to prevent listener accumulation while preserving correct late-update iteration attribution. Added regression coverage for session-bound logging and listener replacement ordering in tests/ralph.test.ts. AC coverage for @cli-ralph remains fully annotated (ac-1..ac-26) with no trait ACs."
      }
    },
